    },
    {
      "text": "Connecting you to a support agent now.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469243999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit support, my name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469246733332
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469252333332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469254333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF886-01. The cycling shoes.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469259333332
    },
    {
      "text": "Got it, thank you. One moment while I pull that up... Okay, I see the order for the VeloFit Carbon cycling shoes, delivered on January 13th. I'm sorry to hear they didn't work out. So I can document this correctly, what specifically was the issue with them?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469262066665
    },
    {
      "text": "They give me blisters. They're just not comfortable.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469279399998
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand, that can definitely ruin a ride. Just to be sure, did you have a chance to adjust the cleats? Sometimes their positioning can cause unexpected pressure points.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469283066664
    },
    {
      "text": "I tried. It didn't help. I just want a refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469294799997
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course, not a problem at all. Let me just check the return eligibility... And yes, you are unfortunately outside our 10-day return window. I've just initiated the return process for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469298066663
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine. So what happens now?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469310199996
    },
    {
      "text": "I've just sent a pre-paid shipping label to the email on file. Just print that out, attach it to the box, and drop it off at any post office. As soon as we receive the shoes back at our warehouse, your full refund will be processed. It typically takes 3-5 business days after we get them.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469312133329
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. As long as it gets done.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469331533329
    },
    {
      "text": "It certainly will. Was there anything else I could assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469333999995
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 66892,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769469339066661
    },
